cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "IQCP: Interactive Quantum Chemistry Playground"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.18798310"
version: 1.0.0-study
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Browser-based educational tool for exploring Boys functions,
  Rys quadrature, and SCF convergence through transparent,
  reproducible computation. All calculations run client-side
  via WebAssembly with no installation required.
